    "NIST mean projected range is used at one energy; it is not a range-straggling or reflection distribution. Consequently a calculated99% mobile routing is not an experimentally supported99% incident-ion collection efficiency.",
    "H2+ is assumed to dissociate into equal-speed H fragments in the stopping material. Molecular stopping, dissociative ionization before acceleration and mixed charge states require their actual spectra.",
    "The controlled cathode is at negative potential behind grounded shielding. Positive ions enter through extraction optics; ionizer electrons remain in their separate return circuit. A negatively biased secondary-suppression electrode around the cathode must return emitted electrons. Escaped secondary electrons add300keV each to the electrical debit.",
    "The candidate shares the hot irradiated barrier, channels, mobile/trapped populations and regeneration qualifications of the main catcher. Ion optical transfer is still an independent factor in eta_net.",
    "The electron-cloud B field does not by itself guide the accelerated heavy ions: the reported ion gyroradii require electrostatic optics and actual trajectories. High voltage vacuum insulation, desorbed gas, joints and pulse shielding remain hardware requirements.",
